stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> EXPLORE
    state "Any live activity" as ACTIVE
    ACTIVE --> DEATH: dead
    DEATH --> EXPLORE: respawn and healthy
    ACTIVE --> BANK_GEMS: engine channel active
    ACTIVE --> RUN_AWAY: danger
