    BANK_GEMS --> EXPLORE: channel completed or interrupted
    EXPLORE --> CAPTURE_POINT: eligible local camp
    CAPTURE_POINT --> PROTECT_POINT: ally occupies reward
    PROTECT_POINT --> EXPLORE: completion, deadline or lost carrier
    CAPTURE_POINT --> EXPLORE: completion or task deadline
